  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCF-EBRD Kazakhstan Renewables Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will support Kazakhstan to develop capacity aggregating ca. 330MW 
RES projects, which will help Kazakhstan to achieve ca. 18% of its 2020 RES goals. 

&#x2022; It provides viable and economic alternative to cheap and abundant coal-based power generation resources
&#x2022; It provides the country with a mechanism to finance projects under the auction mechanism, which would ultimately serve to reduce tariffs.
&#x2022; It aims to address key bottlenecks of current projects, including lack of long tenor financing, and policy challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
